{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"From Repo to Website\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Quarto + GitHub Pages\"\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  revealjs:\n",
        "    title-slide-attributes:\n",
        "      class: title-slide\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Where we are / where we're going\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Already have:** Git/GitHub, Markdown, terminal + VS Code, uv environments.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "**Today:** turn a repo into a website.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Learning goals:**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Explain what GitHub Pages hosts (static files) and how URL works\n",
        "- Create a Quarto website project and preview locally\n",
        "- Publish your site so it updates when you push\n",
        "\n",
        "## Agenda {.section-card}\n",
        "\n",
        "1. The big picture\n",
        "2. GitHub Pages (the hosting)\n",
        "3. Quarto (the builder)\n",
        "4. Publishing (making it live)\n",
        "5. Troubleshooting + portfolio tips\n",
        "\n",
        "## Mental model (keep this in your head) {.section-card}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns-2}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Input**\n",
        "\n",
        "- `.qmd`\n",
        "- data\n",
        "- images\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Pipeline**\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Render:** Quarto + Pandoc (+ Jupyter)\n",
        "- **Output:** static HTML files\n",
        "- **Host:** GitHub Pages\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "GitHub Pages does **not** run Python. Quarto runs Python **before** publishing and saves results into static files.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Discussion {.question-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.discussion-box}\n",
        "Where do you think the most common failure happens in this pipeline: writing the `.qmd`, executing code, rendering to `_site`, or GitHub Pages hosting, and why?\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## GitHub Pages: what it is {.comparison-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns-2}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Pages IS**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Static hosting from a GitHub repo\n",
        "- Great for portfolios/docs/class sites\n",
        "- Configured in Settings\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Pages is NOT**\n",
        "\n",
        "- A database/server\n",
        "- A place for secrets (assume public)\n",
        "- A Python runtime\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## URLs + repo choices\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.tip-box}\n",
        "**Project site (most common):** `https://<user>.github.io/<repo>/`\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "**User site (special repo):** `https://<user>.github.io/` from repo named `<user>.github.io`\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Class tip:** Use one repo per site so URLs stay clean.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Pages settings (what to click)\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Settings > Pages**\n",
        "2. Choose Source:\n",
        "   - Deploy from a branch (simple)\n",
        "   - GitHub Actions (best for Quarto)\n",
        "3. If deploying from branch: pick `main` and folder `/docs`\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.tip-box}\n",
        "**Why `docs/`?** Keeps source files on `main` and built website in `docs/`.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Mini-demo: \"hello Pages\" {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "1. Create repo, add `index.html`\n",
        "2. Push to GitHub\n",
        "3. Turn on Pages\n",
        "4. Visit the URL\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.warning-box}\n",
        "**If 404:** Wait, then check Settings > Pages for deployed URL and build status.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## What is Quarto?\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "Quarto lets you publish Markdown + code + LaTeX to HTML, PDF, slides, and websites.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "- Can execute code using Jupyter kernels\n",
        "- Works with `.qmd` and `.ipynb`\n",
        "- **In class:** portfolio + assignment pages that update from GitHub\n",
        "\n",
        "## Workflow: new project (terminal-friendly) {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "mkdir my_site\n",
        "cd my_site\n",
        "git init\n",
        "uv init\n",
        "uv add jupyter ipykernel\n",
        "quarto preview\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Quarto website project structure\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Two layers of config:**\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "- **`_quarto.yml`** = site-wide settings (nav, theme, output dir)\n",
        "- **Each `.qmd` page** = page-level title, format options, content\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.tip-box}\n",
        "**Rule:** If it applies to the whole site, put it in `_quarto.yml`. If specific to one page, put it in page front matter.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Discussion {.question-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.discussion-box}\n",
        "What belongs in `_quarto.yml` (site-wide) versus in a page's YAML front matter, and what would break if you put it in the wrong place?\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Create a website project (fast start) {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "quarto create project website my_site\n",
        "cd my_site\n",
        "quarto preview\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "**What you'll see:** `_quarto.yml`, `index.qmd`, `about.qmd`\n",
        "\n",
        "## Minimal `_quarto.yml` for GitHub Pages {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "```yaml\n",
        "project:\n",
        "  type: website\n",
        "  output-dir: docs\n",
        "website:\n",
        "  title: \"My Portfolio\"\n",
        "  navbar:\n",
        "    left:\n",
        "      - href: index.qmd\n",
        "        text: Home\n",
        "      - href: projects.qmd\n",
        "        text: Projects\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.warning-box}\n",
        "**Important:** Set `output-dir: docs` if Pages is serving `/docs` on `main`.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## A `.qmd` page: prose + code {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "```yaml\n",
        "---\n",
        "title: \"EDA: Penguins\"\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    code-fold: true\n",
        "jupyter: python3\n",
        "---\n",
        "```"
      ],
      "id": "4d99a155"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
