      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Good portfolio pages:** Short intro (what question?), 1-3 key visuals, a \"so what?\" paragraph.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## The local loop\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns-2}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**The loop**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Edit in VS Code\n",
        "- Run `quarto preview`\n",
        "- Browser auto-refreshes on save\n",
        "- `quarto render` to build full site\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Why preview?**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Fast feedback\n",
        "- Don't debug deploy problems while also debugging your analysis\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Reproducibility: `.gitignore` + environments\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "**Add to `.gitignore`:**\n",
        "```\n",
        ".quarto/\n",
        "site_libs/\n",
        "*_files/\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Keep Python environment in repo:** `uv` manages dependencies. If needed: `uv pip freeze > requirements.txt`\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Two deployment strategies {.comparison-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns-2}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**A. Build locally, commit `docs/`**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Simple mental model\n",
        "- Works without Actions\n",
        "- **Downside:** must remember to render + commit\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**B. GitHub Actions builds on push**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Best for \"always up to date\"\n",
        "- More moving parts\n",
        "- Once set, it's done\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Strategy A: build locally (fastest to teach) {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "quarto render\n",
        "git add docs\n",
        "git commit -m \"Render site\"\n",
        "git push\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.tip-box}\n",
        "**Pages setting:** Settings > Pages > Deploy from branch: `main` + `/docs`\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Strategy B: GitHub Actions (starter concept) {.demo-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.demo-box}\n",
        "- Workflow file under `.github/workflows/`\n",
        "- Pages source set to **GitHub Actions**\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "**Conceptual steps:**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Checkout repo\n",
        "2. Install Quarto + Python\n",
        "3. `quarto render`\n",
        "4. Upload site to Pages\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Class note:** Provide pre-made workflow so students don't write YAML from scratch.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common gotchas (and quick fixes) {.reference-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.cheat-grid}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**404 or blank page**\n",
        "\n",
        "Pages not pointed at right folder (use `docs/`)\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Site doesn't update**\n",
        "\n",
        "Forgot to push, or Actions failed\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Broken images**\n",
        "\n",
        "Path issues (use relative paths)\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Render fails**\n",
        "\n",
        "Missing package in your environment\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.warning-box}\n",
        "**Debug routine:** Check (1) local preview, (2) repo contents (`docs/`), (3) Pages/Actions status.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Troubleshooting (pipeline diagram repeat)\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "Input → Render → Output → Host\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns-2}\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Check each stage**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Input: `.qmd` valid?\n",
        "- Render: packages present?\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<div>\n",
        "**Check each stage**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Output: `docs/` built?\n",
        "- Host: Pages pointed at `docs/`?\n",
        "</div>\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Portfolio structure that scales\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.tip-box}\n",
        "**Recommended navbar:** Home (who you are), Projects (2-4 highlights), Assignments (organized by week/topic), Final Project, About/Resume.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**Design rule:** Make it skimmable: headings, short paragraphs, figures with captions.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## In-class checklist (today) {.exercise-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.exercise-check}\n",
        "1. Create Quarto website project\n",
        "2. Set `output-dir: docs` in `_quarto.yml`\n",
        "3. Preview locally\n",
        "4. Push to GitHub\n",
        "5. Turn on Pages (`main` + `/docs`)\n",
        "6. Confirm your site URL works\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Wrap-up {.takeaway-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "- Quarto builds the static site from `.qmd`\n",
        "- GitHub Pages hosts the built static files\n",
        "- Your portfolio is a software project: version control + environment + reproducible build\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.key-idea}\n",
        "**\"Ship your work.\"**\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: notes\n",
        "This deck walks students from repo to live website in one session.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Slide 2 sets learning goals; emphasize that GitHub Pages only serves static files.\n",
        "- Slide 4 mental model is the backbone — return to it when troubleshooting.\n",
        "- Slide 6 IS/NOT comparison clarifies the most common misconceptions about Pages.\n",
        "- Slides 11 and 14 give two paths to a project: manual (terminal-friendly) vs. `quarto create`.\n",
        "- Slide 15 minimal `_quarto.yml` is the config students will actually use.\n",
        "- Slides 19-21 contrast the two deployment strategies; recommend Strategy A for first-time setup.\n",
        "- Slide 22 gotchas reference is worth bookmarking — most student issues live here.\n",
        "- Slide 25 is the in-class exercise; confirm each step before moving on.\n",
        "- Close with the wrap-up: the portfolio is a reproducible software project.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Questions? {.question-slide}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.discussion-box}\n",
        "Take 2 minutes — what is one thing from today that is still unclear?\n",
        ":::\n"
      ],
      "id": "4e0f471a"
    }
